  "details": "While custom animation safety setting is allowed it changes the root position Y and/or breaks the animation entirely of a custom animation on the action layer. When custom animation is disabled the animations position is correct. Either way things look correct locally it's only other people that see the animation wrong. Edit: Scaling the avatar to 1 xyz in unity fixes this problem.",
